      "type": "code",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 162,
      "raw": "```python\n# 在默认情况下，PyTorch会累积梯度，我们需要清除之前的值\nx.grad.zero_()\ny = x.sum()\ny.backward()\nx.grad\n```",
