      "type": "code",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 328,
      "raw": "```python\ndef f(a):\n    b = a * 2\n    while b.norm() < 1000:\n        b = b * 2\n    if b.sum() > 0:\n        c = b\n    else:\n        c = 100 * b\n    return c\n```",
